*PPD-Adobe: "4.3"
*% Polono D810 portable thermal printer (A4 / Letter / Legal).
*% Raster is produced by the d810-filter, see ~/d810-driver/d810.py.
*FormatVersion: "4.3"
*FileVersion: "1.0"
*LanguageVersion: English
*LanguageEncoding: ISOLatin1
*PCFileName: "D810.PPD"
*Manufacturer: "Polono"
*Product: "(D810)"
*ModelName: "Polono D810"
*ShortNickName: "Polono D810"
*NickName: "Polono D810 (open driver)"
*1284DeviceID: "MFG:;CMD:XPP,XL;MDL:D810;CLS:PRINTER;DES:D810;"
*PSVersion: "(3010.000) 0"
*LanguageLevel: "3"
*ColorDevice: False
*DefaultColorSpace: Gray
*FileSystem: False
*Throughput: "1"
*cupsVersion: 2.4
*cupsManualCopies: True
*cupsFilter: "application/pdf 0 d810-filter"

*% Printable area matches Polono's own macOS PPD.
*OpenUI *PageSize/Paper Size: PickOne
*OrderDependency: 10 AnySetup *PageSize
*DefaultPageSize: A4
*PageSize A4/A4 (switch on 210): "<</PageSize[572 826]/ImagingBBox null>>setpagedevice"
*PageSize Letter/US Letter (switch on 216): "<</PageSize[589 790]/ImagingBBox null>>setpagedevice"
*PageSize Legal/US Legal (switch on 216): "<</PageSize[589 993]/ImagingBBox null>>setpagedevice"
*CloseUI: *PageSize

*OpenUI *PageRegion: PickOne
*OrderDependency: 10 AnySetup *PageRegion
*DefaultPageRegion: A4
*PageRegion A4/A4: "<</PageSize[572 826]/ImagingBBox null>>setpagedevice"
*PageRegion Letter/US Letter: "<</PageSize[589 790]/ImagingBBox null>>setpagedevice"
*PageRegion Legal/US Legal: "<</PageSize[589 993]/ImagingBBox null>>setpagedevice"
*CloseUI: *PageRegion

*DefaultImageableArea: A4
*ImageableArea A4: "0 0 572 826"
*ImageableArea Letter: "0 0 589 790"
*ImageableArea Legal: "0 0 589 993"
*DefaultPaperDimension: A4
*PaperDimension A4: "572 826"
*PaperDimension Letter: "589 790"
*PaperDimension Legal: "589 993"

*OpenUI *MediaType/Paper Type: PickOne
*OrderDependency: 20 AnySetup *MediaType
*DefaultMediaType: Fold
*MediaType Fold/Fold paper (black marks): ""
*MediaType Roll/Roll or single sheets: ""
*MediaType Label/Label paper: ""
*MediaType Tattoo/Tattoo transfer paper: ""
*CloseUI: *MediaType

*OpenUI *Darkness/Darkness: PickOne
*OrderDependency: 20 AnySetup *Darkness
*DefaultDarkness: High
*Darkness Low/Low: ""
*Darkness Medium/Medium: ""
*Darkness High/High: ""
*CloseUI: *Darkness

*OpenUI *Resolution/Resolution: PickOne
*OrderDependency: 10 AnySetup *Resolution
*DefaultResolution: 203dpi
*Resolution 203dpi/203 dpi: "<</HWResolution[203 203]>>setpagedevice"
*CloseUI: *Resolution
